[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES]
Control South Luna Isles

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES_desc]
Las Pegasus Group hopes to develop its own industry on the isles of the South Luna Ocean, while the islands controlled by the pirates have become obstacles in Las Pegasus’ South Luna Ocean development plan. Of course, we hope to solve this problem peacefully with the pirates, by, for example, not letting them know.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES]
控制南露娜群岛

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_ISLES_desc]
洛马基集团希望能够在南露娜洋的岛屿上开发自己的产业，而海盗们所控制的岛屿则在洛马基的南露娜洋开发计划中成为了障碍。当然，我们希望与海盗们和平解决这个问题，比如说，不让他们知道。

